            </span>
            <h3 class="hp-svc__title">Off the mains, or wish you were?</h3>
            <p class="hp-svc__desc">Private water supplies designed around your source, built to run for decades.</p>
            <span class="hp-svc__go">Private water supplies <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
